{"id":"cda9314b8ea1ffd0f736c3e7e9e74f87588e3e4e988cd5a703c0a9beb7a93b08","at":"2026-10-03T14:16:42Z","commit":"368bc5eaff91ebc675c42a50d018a9ebee99e93b","parents":["9747293b292ed02f81063236aa15b29eaa10ad4fd86129fa545d593410b2243b"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Depdep.CLIRebuiltIntegrationTest: a hit Mix would rebuild is counted as a miss, said, and compiled","hash":"8c1dc22b"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/06-the-run.md#restore-check-rebuckets","hash":"bda0c718"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"probe: the integration test drives the real binary and asserts the rebuilt clause, the miss count and that --compile-deps compiled it","basis":"review"}
{"id":"c36ef2d2443e35e1da312379dd525f7c2b739c9c2c9005fd4f4c08a22f7e6e65","at":"2026-10-03T14:17:47Z","commit":"368bc5eaff91ebc675c42a50d018a9ebee99e93b","parents":["675e9764a6025848deace791607b580d84e052f30191119405e456c1e5d68914"],"op":"relate","type":"tests","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Depdep.CLIRebuiltIntegrationTest: a hit Mix would rebuild is counted as a miss, said, and compiled","hash":"8c1dc22b"},{"kind":"code","id":"Depdep.RestoreCheck.statuses/2","hash":"1797060f"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"#136: recorded by hand because this test drives the real binary in a SUBPROCESS, so the scanner's static call analysis cannot see it. The relation is true — the run reaches statuses/2 — and surfex accepts and does not flag it. It does not however make 'validate' credit statuses/2, because 'exercised' is computed from the test item's static calls, not from tests relations. See dco-tek/surfex for the ask."}
{"id":"e26fad1e95e60783e98a98794d547969780bef16a27f3ca106efcdce3e654486","at":"2026-10-03T14:17:48Z","commit":"368bc5eaff91ebc675c42a50d018a9ebee99e93b","parents":["cda9314b8ea1ffd0f736c3e7e9e74f87588e3e4e988cd5a703c0a9beb7a93b08"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Depdep.CLIRebuiltIntegrationTest: a hit Mix would rebuild is counted as a miss, said, and compiled","hash":"8c1dc22b"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/06-the-run.md#restore-check-rebuckets","hash":"bda0c718"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"#136: the integration test drives the real binary and asserts the rebuilt clause, the recounted miss and that --compile-deps compiled it — the hint's three claims.","basis":"proposed"}
